        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "39-3 If the Board determines that teachers should be laid off (cancellation of employment) by reason of financial neces-sity, declining enrollment, or for other reasons justify-ing a decrease in the number of teaching positions, the District will institute the procedure described hereafter. This procedure shall apply equally to all teachers defined in Section 39-1-1.",
