        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "39-4-1 Before District representatives recommend a reduction in force to the Board, the Association will be notified of the conditions necessitating the reduction. If possible, said notification will be given by November 1 prior to a semester layoff, or by March 1 of the school year preceding an anticipated end-of-the-year layoff. With such notification, the Superintendent or his/her designee will furnish the Association with relevant data necessitating the cancellation of employment contracts. Layoffs will only occur at the end of a semester or academic year.",
            "block_bbox": [
